    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hibiscus Red | Part 1: Voices from beyond</h2><br>In the first part of this new adventure game series Hibiscus discovers the shocking truth about his father and sets out on a journey to save his family and the world. Or is it worlds?<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Almost classic point and click adventure game<br></li><li> Part 1 of 4 with around 40 minutes of gameplay<br></li><li> Multi-language support: English and german texts<br></li><li> Text-to-speech option for english language.<br></li><li> No hint mechanics, so not so easy I guess, yes it's a feature!</li></ul>",
